{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "truck",
  "name": "Truck",
  "description": "A large, heavy road vehicle: box trucks, delivery vans, campervans and small buses. Slow to pull away, firmly sprung, with a high chase camera.",
  "comment": "A vehicle preset (#728); see sedan.json for the format. Sized so the real-scale Fab box truck of the owner's test pack (wheel radius about 44.6, track about 170) and campervan (radius about 39, track about 160) come out near 1.0.",
